{"4681970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Naysayer", "steam_appid": 4681970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A souls-like story penned atop digital parchment. <br><br>Decide where the story goes, what actions you'll take, how you'll fight, and what you'll say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Centred around one boss: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your foe, and find a way to defeat <i>him</i>. Use perseverance, hidden tactics, and refutes to prove your innocence against unjust allegations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t let <i>his </i>trickery mislead you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll be corralled and persuaded to believe things that aren’t true. Hold tight to who you know yourself to be.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust your advisors:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean on the wisdom and experience of your entourage. They're there to help.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content warning</strong>: this game covers uncomfortable material and is not suitable for children, or for everyone. A detailed (spoiler-ish) content warning can also be found in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A souls-like story penned atop digital parchment. <br><br>Decide where the story goes, what actions you'll take, how you'll fight, and what you'll say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Centred around one boss: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your foe, and find a way to defeat <i>him</i>. Use perseverance, hidden tactics, and refutes to prove your innocence against unjust allegations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don’t let <i>his </i>trickery mislea